1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,137
Startup ASEAN creates thousands of
connections.

2
00:00:04,187 --> 00:00:06,750
But how many become real deals?

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,387
Today, nobody can say.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:15,637
Nexus Net turns those connections into
measurable outcomes — as a game.

5
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,412
Startups register and upload their company
documents.

6
00:00:27,462 --> 00:00:31,517
Gemma 4 checks the name, registration
number and country,

7
00:00:31,567 --> 00:00:34,375
and issues a verified company passport.

8
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:47,925
Every startup levels up — from Connected,
all the way to Funded.

9
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:58,475
Six quick taps,

10
00:00:58,525 --> 00:01:03,375
and Gemma turns their gaps into quests —
matched with the right talent.

11
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:17,612
Gemma 4 writes personalised, cross-border
quests.

12
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:28,312
Upload the proof.

13
00:01:28,362 --> 00:01:32,987
Gemma verifies it, XP jumps, and the
startup levels up.

14
00:01:33,037 --> 00:01:35,187
That's a real outcome.

15
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:54,362
Founders discover the right ecosystem
events — and earn bonus XP for showing up.

16
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:06,137
Startups compete for the top of the season
leaderboard.

17
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:20,125
The live ASEAN map draws every verified
cross-border outcome.

18
00:02:20,175 --> 00:02:24,462
Filter by type, or follow one startup
across the region.

19
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:36,622
And Cradle finally sees the funnel — from
connection to investment — live,

20
00:02:36,672 --> 00:02:38,350
by country and by event.

21
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:47,262
Nexus Net.

22
00:02:47,312 --> 00:02:50,137
Every quest is a measurable outcome.

23
00:02:50,187 --> 00:02:52,337
Built with Gemma 4.
